cff-version: 1.2.0
title: The Calibrated Authority Index
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Reitz
    given-names: Chris Huber
    affiliation: Attainable AI
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3190-4158"
abstract: >-
  A living corpus coding how knowledge institutions construct trust in generative
  AI. Each institution's public AI policy is scored on six dimensions into a
  composite Calibrated Authority (CA) score 0-12, anchored to a verbatim quote
  and source. N=51 institutions; mean CA 9.8/12.
url: "https://calibrated-authority.chrishuberreitz.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/chrishuberreitz/calibrated-authority-index"
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "2026-06-22"
date-released: "2026-06-22"
keywords:
  - Calibrated Authority
  - Anticipatory Reciprocity
  - AI trust
  - AI governance
  - generative AI policy
  - verification economics
  - trust formation
  - AI authorship
  - Organizational Intelligence Design
  - AEO
